              "id": "u2LLFk",
              "name": "Spec",
              "fill": "$muted-foreground",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Chip → line 1 → line 2 → subhead → buttons → install, 100ms apart. Fade + rise 8px, 400ms, cubic-bezier(0.2, 0, 0, 1). Once, on load.",
