        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "XKs0v",
          "name": "Row Cards on scroll",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "stroke": "$hairline",
          "strokeWidth": {
            "top": 1
          },
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 4,
          "padding": [
            12,
            0,
            0,
            0
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "T2qKGn",
              "name": "Name",
              "fill": "$foreground",
              "content": "Cards on scroll — wave + layered preview",
              "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "XjezD",
              "name": "Spec",
              "fill": "$muted-foreground",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Scroll-driven (view() timeline), no JS. Each column starts 12% of the entry later, so a row arrives as a left → right wave: fade + rise 24px + scale 0.96 → 1 + blur 4px → 0. The inset preview follows the card's timeline but starts later, lifting from 0.94 → 1. Static where unsupported.",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
              "fontSize": 11.5,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "Wdfde",
          "name": "Row Install command",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "stroke": "$hairline",
          "strokeWidth": {
            "top": 1
          },
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 4,
          "padding": [
            12,
            0,
            0,
            0
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "JSmpr",
              "name": "Name",
              "fill": "$foreground",
              "content": "Install command — colours, odometer, one rotation",
              "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "LtJSi",
              "name": "Spec",
              "fill": "$muted-foreground",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Colours: the docs' code theme — runner orange, flags purple, keywords blue, the component name a deeper blue; @reziui/ muted. Odometer: switching package manager rolls only the runner — old slides up and out, new up from below, 200ms; the slot's width eases so the rest glides. Rotation: the first time the block is 60% on screen, the name rolls button → dialog → select → button (start 700ms, every 1.1s, done in under 5s), then stops for good. Hover or focus cancels it; reduced motion skips it.",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
              "fontSize": 11.5,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "zDVD2",
          "name": "Row Spotlight",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "stroke": "$hairline",
          "strokeWidth": {
            "top": 1
          },
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 4,
          "padding": [
